                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The term \"total hourly earnings\" is defined as wages (excluding payments of clothing allowances, moving and educational expenses, and prior Supplemental Wage Payments paid under this Article) while in the Bargaining Unit.",
