                    101.0,
                    485.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "All employees on Medical or Personal Leave of Absence, or Lay Off as of May 21, 2005, who return to the active payroll prior to May 20, 2006, for at least 30 calendar days, will receive a pro rata portion of the $3000 Lump Sum Payment on the payday associated with the pay period commencing May 20, 2006, based upon the percentage of time worked during the period May 21, 2005 to May 20, 2006.",
            "block_bbox": [
                125,
