        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The parties agree to a general wage increase in the base rates of pay for employees on the payroll April 22, 2006. The general increase will be applicable to employees in labor grades 1 through 24. The amount of general increase and adjusted rate range for each labor grade are as shown in Section D.1.",
