        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The parties agree to a general increase in the base rates of pay for employees on the payroll on April 21, 2007. The general increase will be applicable to employees in labor grades 1 through 24. The amount of general increase and adjusted rate range are as shown in Section D.2.",
